Package: orc
Version: 0.4.38-r0.3
Description: Optimised Inner Loop Runtime Compiler
 Optimised Inner Loop Runtime Compiler is a Library and set of tools for
 compiling and executing SIMD assembly language-like programs that operate
 on arrays of data.
